 "remarks": "105 Rose Lane blends classic charm with modern updates in a welcoming Darien neighborhood. This sun-filled 4-bedroom, 2-bath home features an open-concept first floor, an updated kitchen, and beautifully renovated bathrooms for a move-in ready experience. An additional living space offers flexibility for relaxing or entertaining, while the fantastic front porch is perfect for enjoying morning coffee or evening unwinding. Tucked on a quiet private road, the home offers a sense of privacy with a friendly, community feel. A finished basement provides space for a playroom, gym, or home office. Conveniently located just half a mile from the elementary school and close to Darien Commons for dining and shopping, with the train less than a mile away for an easy commute.",
